e2e/replay-package/

# Issue #117 Screen Verification Gate — local run output only.
# The harness lives in e2e/verification/issue-117/ and is committed; its
# output (reproduced Pages payload, screenshots, videos, traces, and the
# packaged artifact ZIP) is not, per the same no-committed-video rule as
# e2e/replay-package/ above.
.verification/
SES_ISSUE-117_Screen_Verification_Artifacts.zip
